{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/ff2e2a4270ae05402e30b657c7d7b87f.poster.avif?t=1771229185\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/ff2e2a4270ae05402e30b657c7d7b87f.webm?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/ff2e2a4270ae05402e30b657c7d7b87f.mp4?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Midnight Makeover: House Flipping with a Haunted Twist</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/31dc4fe6b5d6808df52cac27e8666230.poster.avif?t=1771229185\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/31dc4fe6b5d6808df52cac27e8666230.webm?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/31dc4fe6b5d6808df52cac27e8666230.mp4?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a Haunted House Cleaning &amp; Renovation Simulator!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror Meets Renovation</h2>Welcome to a house-flipping experience like no other. In this haunted building, every renovation comes with a chill. You\u2019re not just fixing up old spaces\u2014you\u2019re uncovering the deepest fears of humanity. Each room hides a story, and it\u2019s up to you to turn these cursed spaces into homes, all while something sinister watches your every move.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/92304b3f505843c34da95c0be3e33268.poster.avif?t=1771229185\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/92304b3f505843c34da95c0be3e33268.webm?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/92304b3f505843c34da95c0be3e33268.mp4?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Renovate, Clean, and Uncover Secrets</h2>Take on the usual tasks of painting, cleaning, and repairs, but don\u2019t get too comfortable. As you work, you\u2019ll need to solve puzzles, uncover hidden crypts with UV light, and purify them with holy water. Every job is a battle against the unknown.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/97a8316c5b848d145b6e5b16a8ab5639.poster.avif?t=1771229185\" width=610 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/97a8316c5b848d145b6e5b16a8ab5639.webm?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/97a8316c5b848d145b6e5b16a8ab5639.mp4?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn, Upgrade, Survive</h2>With each successful flip, you\u2019ll earn money to upgrade your tools and skills. Better equipment means faster, safer renovations, but the challenges will only grow. The deeper you go into this haunted building, the darker the secrets you\u2019ll uncover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/d79ae6e1d5fdb4c9530abdb63ccf4520.poster.avif?t=1771229185\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/d79ae6e1d5fdb4c9530abdb63ccf4520.webm?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/d79ae6e1d5fdb4c9530abdb63ccf4520.mp4?t=1771229185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay Sane, Stay Alive</h2>You\u2019re never alone in this building, and the ghost inside will test your sanity at every turn. Safe Rooms offer brief moments of peace, but you\u2019ll need to watch your back constantly. Losing your grip on reality means losing everything.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progressive Terrors and Unseen Dangers</h2>As you progress, the houses become more challenging, the encounters more terrifying. This isn\u2019t just about making money\u2014it\u2019s about facing your fears and surviving the Midnight Makeover.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2848570?t=1771229185","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771229185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/ff3d677bfa4b01652f7a9f2651731173243430a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771229185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/ff3d677bfa4b01652f7a9f2651731173243430a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771229185","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Bunch of Jumpscares, horror elements."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848570/extras/ff2e2a4270ae05402e30b657c7d7b87f.poster.avif?t=1771229185\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\